.Dd August 23, 2026
.Dt PQFREEBSD_COMPAT_ZFS_MULTILABEL 4
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm pqfreebsd_compat_zfs_multilabel
.Nd set MNT_MULTILABEL on ZFS mounts with xattr enabled
.Sh SYNOPSIS
ZFS hosts only.
To load the module at boot time, place the following lines in
.Xr loader.conf 5 :
.Bd -literal -offset indent
pqfreebsd_load="YES"
pqfreebsd_compat_zfs_multilabel_load="YES"
.Ed
.Pp
Alternatively, to load the module at run time after
.Xr pqfreebsd 4 :
.Bd -literal -offset indent
kldload pqfreebsd_compat_zfs_multilabel
.Ed
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a
.Em ZFS-only
compat module for the
.Nm pqfreebsd
project
.Pq pqk .
Legacy UFS/FFS already sets
.Dv MNT_MULTILABEL
and never had this regression.
OpenZFS mounts that omit the flag receive it unless the mount has
.Cm noxattr .
The inherited
.Cm xattr
property is not readable from another KLD:
.Nm zfs.ko
does not export
.Fn dsl_prop_get_integer .
OpenZFS default is
.Cm xattr
on.
A proper fix will go upstream.
.Pp
On
.Dv MOD_LOAD
the module registers a
.Dv vfs_mounted
handler and scans active ZFS mounts.
Each mount newly marked emits a
.Xr log 9
.Dv LOG_INFO
line.
The handler is dropped in
.Dv MOD_QUIESCE .
.Pp
This module depends on
.Nm pqfreebsd
and
.Nm zfsctrl
via
.Fn MODULE_DEPEND .
.Xr pqfreebsd 4
does not load it;
pqf skills or
.Xr loader 8
do when ZFS is in play.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Pa /boot/modules/pqfreebsd_compat_zfs_multilabel.ko
The
.Nm
kernel module.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mac 4 ,
.Xr pqfreebsd 4 ,
.Xr loader.conf 5 ,
.Xr kldload 8 ,
.Xr mount 8 ,
.Xr zfs 8 ,
.Xr log 9
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
module first appeared in pqk as a ZFS-only accommodation until a proper
.Dv MNT_MULTILABEL
fix goes upstream.
.Sh AUTHORS
.An -nosplit
This module was written by
.An Brian Fundakowski Feldman Aq Mt brianisbornagain@gmail.com .
.Sh BUGS
Does not clear
.Dv MNT_MULTILABEL
on unload.
Remounts that change
.Cm xattr
are not observed until reload or a new mount.
Datasets with
.Cm xattr=off
and no
.Cm noxattr
mount option are treated as enabled.
